{"canonical_levels": {"revision": "de8c614ada6e3ae9f9072cedb7521fb96c1d13e5", "scheme_id": "default", "scheme_version": 2, "preamble": "A level is the performance a student must show to answer correctly. It is NOT the length of the text, NOT the amount of numbers to read, and NOT the verb used in the outcome sentence.", "levels": [{"code": "NB", "label": {"vi": "Nhận biết", "en": "Recall"}, "ordinal": 1, "status": "APPROVED", "definition_en": "recognise or retrieve. The student recognises, names or restates a fact, concept, definition, symbol, property, formula or step as taught. The answer sits in ONE knowledge unit. A scenario, if any, is decoration.", "samples": [], "bands": []}, {"code": "TH", "label": {"vi": "Thông hiểu", "en": "Comprehension"}, "ordinal": 2, "status": "APPROVED", "definition_en": "Explain, distinguish, interpret, or execute a familiar routine procedure. The student reads a given representation or uses taught knowledge in a standard exercise. A single substitution of given values into a taught formula or equation is TH; several routine algebraic or numerical operations can also remain TH. Choosing the obvious familiar formula without its name being supplied does not by itself make a question VD.", "samples": [], "bands": []}, {"code": "VD", "label": {"vi": "Vận dụng", "en": "Application"}, "ordinal": 3, "status": "APPROVED", "definition_en": "Model a situation or construct a substantive chain of reasoning. The task requires the student to formulate a model, connect and apply multiple knowledge units, or plan and justify several dependent thinking steps rather than merely execute a familiar calculation. Judge the minimum cognitive work needed for a correct answer. A longer text, more numbers, more written calculation steps, or an unstated but obvious formula is not sufficient for VD. A standard multi-step calculation can remain TH; no single surface cue is a compulsory condition for all VD questions.", "samples": [], "bands": []}], "subject_laye